142
00:29:09,039 --> 00:29:10,930
Tonight, let us celebrate.
今晚，让我们庆祝一下。

143
00:29:14,950 --> 00:29:17,310
Tomorrow, let us get to work.
明天，让我们开始工作吧。

144
00:29:22,110 --> 00:29:28,530
Together, we are going to build an Ohio where no matter where you were born, You belong.
我们将共同建设一个俄亥俄州，无论你出生在哪里，你属于。

145
00:29:29,350 --> 00:29:34,890
You can build the life of your dreams and you can be whoever you want to be.
你可以建立你梦想的生活，你可以成为任何你想成为的人。

146
00:29:34,890 --> 00:29:37,330
Maybe even governor.
也许甚至是州长。

147
00:29:44,310 --> 00:29:45,610
Thank you.
谢谢你。

148
00:29:46,190 --> 00:29:49,290
Thank you for trusting and believing in me.
感谢您对我的信任和信任。

149
00:29:56,970 --> 00:29:58,550
I love you, too.
我也爱你。

150
00:30:00,940 --> 00:30:07,300
I will be with you, fighting alongside of you every step of the way.
我会和你在一起，与你并肩作战。

151
00:30:07,840 --> 00:30:10,950
Thank you, Ohio.
谢谢你，俄亥俄州。

152
00:30:10,960 --> 00:30:13,050
Thank you.
谢谢你。

153
00:30:13,060 --> 00:30:16,000
Thank you.
谢谢你。
